QUESTION 3: TRIP SPEED AND FUEL COST
FLOWCHART
                 ( START )
                     |
                     v
          /-------------------------/
         / Input Distance, Hours,    /
        / Minutes, Fuel Rate and     /
       / Fuel Price                 /
        /-------------------------/
                     |
                     v
          +-------------------------+
          | Calculate Total Time    |
          | = Hours + Minutes / 60  |
          +------------+------------+
                       |
                       v
          +-------------------------+
          | Calculate Average Speed |
          | = Distance / Total Time |
          +------------+------------+
                       |
                       v
          +-------------------------+
          | Calculate Fuel Used     |
          | = Distance * Fuel Rate  |
          | / 100                   |
          +------------+------------+
                       |
                       v
          +-------------------------+
          | Calculate Fuel Cost     |
          | = Fuel Used * Fuel Price|
          +------------+------------+
